{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37395","headline":"送许户曹 · 唐彦谦","name":"送许户曹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"沙头小燕鸣春和，杨柳垂丝烟倒拖。\n将军楼船发浩歌，云樯高插天嵯峨。\n白虹走香倾翠壶，劝饮花前金叵罗。\n神鳌驾粟升天河，新承雨泽浮恩波。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"唐彦谦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37395.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37395","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}